Usage: counselors [options] [command]

Fan out prompts to multiple AI coding tools (agents) in parallel

Options:
  -V, --version             output the version number
  -h, --help                display help for command

Commands:
  run [options] [prompt]    Dispatch prompt to configured AI tools in parallel
  loop [options] [prompt]   Multi-round dispatch — tools (agents) iterate,
                            seeing prior outputs each round
  mkdir [options] [prompt]  Create an output directory and optionally write
                            prompt.md without dispatching (supports prompt arg,
                            -f, or stdin)
  cleanup [options]         Delete run output directories older than a given age
  config                    Show resolved configuration
  doctor                    Check tool configuration and health
  init [options]            Interactive setup wizard
  agent                     Print setup and skill installation instructions
